1. Use if-else to find the greatest of 3 numbers ( a=10,b=23,c=5)

public class PracticeSession {

	public static void main(String[] args) {
		
		int a=10;
		int b=23;
		int c=5;
		
		if (a>b && a>c) {
			System.out.println("10 is the greatest number");
		}
		else if(b>a && b>c) {
			System.out.println("23 is the greatest number");

		}
		else if(c>a && c>b) {
			System.out.println("5 is the greatest number");

		}
	}

}

Output: 23 is the greatest number

